/P 425 0 R
/E (Automated scanning. No automated vulnerability scanners were used. All findings were identified through manual request analysis and parameter manipulation. Automation was limited to request replay for credential and enumeration testing \(BB-05, BB-22\), where the volume of candidate values made manual submission impractical. A configured commercial scanner may surface additional issues, particularly in areas not reached manually.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
697 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 425 0 R
/E (Privilege perspective. Testing was performed from an authenticated low-privilege staff account. No administrative account was provided, so privileged functionality was assessed only where it could be reached through escalation. Weaknesses reachable exclusively from an administrative session were not in scope.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
