/E (Exploitation depth. Findings were confirmed to the point of demonstrating impact, not developed to full exploitation. The blind injection at /promo/check \(BB-17\) was confirmed through its boolean oracle and cross-validated against data recovered via BB-06 rather than by exhaustive character-by-character extraction. The one-time code brute force described in BB-04 is derived from the observed behaviour of the issuance and verification handlers; the full attack was not executed. No destructive action was taken against application data.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
