849 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 427 0 R
/E (The File Vault accepts uploaded files with no extension or MIME validation, preserving the original filename. Separately, the /view endpoint passes its page parameter directly into a PHP include statement without sanitisation, permitting traversal outside the intended templates directory. Chained, these allow any authenticated staff user to upload a PHP file and have the server execute it, resulting in arbitrary command execution as the web server user.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
