1039 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 442 0 R
/E (Successful and failed attempts are distinguishable from the response: a successful login issues a Set-Cookie: mrd_prefs header and redirects to /dashboard, while a failure returns no cookie and redirects to /login?e=Invalid+credentials. This provides a reliable oracle for automated attack.)
