1397 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 468 0 R
/E (The Team Chat feature connects to a WebSocket service that accepts a join action containing a client-supplied conversation_id and account_id. The handshake carries no session, and the server performs no membership check before returning conversation history. The application maintains an accurate conversation membership table and correctly filters the conversation list shown in the interface. That data is simply not consulted when a join request arrives, so any authenticated user can read any conversation by substituting its identifier.)
/Pg 60 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
