/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 514 0 R
/E (Every application response discloses the exact version of the web server and the PHP interpreter through the Server and X-Powered-By headers. Both are returned by default and neither has been suppressed.)
/Pg 106 0 R
/K [13]
>>
