2072 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 514 0 R
/E (The disclosure grants no access by itself. Its effect is to remove a reconnaissance step: an attacker learns the precise software versions in use without probing for behavioural fingerprints, and can match them directly against public vulnerability databases.)
/Pg 106 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
