2153 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 517 0 R
/E (The Meridian Corp staff portal is exploitable to full server compromise by any user holding a low-privilege account, and to complete account takeover by an attacker holding no credentials at all. Both outcomes were demonstrated within a two-day assessment using manual testing alone. Twenty-seven findings were identified, of which five are Critical and nine are High.)
/Pg 109 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
