>>
endobj
2155 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 517 0 R
/E (The prioritised roadmap in Section 1 sequences the work by leverage. The first item closes both paths to remote code execution and requires only a few lines of change; it should be treated as immediate. Transport encryption \(BB-20\) should be scheduled alongside it rather than after, since no credential or session control described in this report is effective while traffic remains unencrypted. A retest is recommended once the roadmap has been implemented, to confirm the fixes are effective and that no regressions have been introduced.)
/Pg 109 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
